   Aabi A, 2022, J AFR EARTH SCI, V196, DOI 10.1016/j.jafrearsci.2022.104731.
   Abdelkareem M, 2021, REMOTE SENS-BASEL, V13, DOI 10.3390/rs13224492.
   Adiri Z, 2020, GEOCARTO INT, V35, P781, DOI 10.1080/10106049.2018.1544287.
